<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $375 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $375 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Monday said it will redeem all outstanding amounts of six medium-term note issues totalling $375 million as follows.</p>
<p>  Principal     Interest    Maturity    Cusip     Redemption</p>
<p>   Amount	   Rate	  Date	Number	Date</p>
<p>  $50 million     7.375     07/30/01   31364CGT9   07/31/97</p>
<p>  $50 million     7.12	08/08/01   31364CHS0   08/08/97</p>
<p>  $50 million     7.20	08/19/02   31364BHR4   08/20/97</p>
<p>  $50 million     6.70	10/11/00   31364BMR8   08/20/97</p>
<p>  $75 million     7.30	08/21/02   31364BHX1   08/21/97</p>
<p> $100 million     7.14	08/25/99   31364A2S0   08/25/97</p>
<p>The redemption price of the notes will be 100 percent of the principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
